==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|zwō|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|twai||lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tsvoː/|lang=de}}

===Numeral===
'''zwo'''

# [[two]]

====Usage notes====
*''[[zwei|Zwei]]'' is the usual German word for "two", but ''zwo'' is sometimes used as more clearly distinguishable from ''[[drei]]'' ("three"), especially over the telephone. Used more in South Germany and Austria.

====Synonyms====
* [[zwei]]

